4. Qc1 { A quiet way to guard b2 without risk. It is a little less ambitious than Nc3 (the engine calls it level), but there are no tricks to know. } 4... Nc6 5. Nf3 cxd4 6. exd4 { Recapture with the pawn so the e-file and the bishop on f4 stay open. } 6... Nf6 7. c3 Bf5 8. Nbd2 *
